<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
        .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); overflow: hidden; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .logo { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .title { font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.95; font-weight: 400; }
        .content { padding: 40px 32px; }
        .message { font-size: 15px; color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.65; }
        .verification-code { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .code {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 18px 28px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .warning { background-color: #D6E8FF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; }
        .warning-text { color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; color: #6c757d; font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">file-am</div>
            <div class="title">Verify Your Email Address</div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
        <div class="message">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>Thank you for signing up with file-am. To complete your registration, please verify your email address using the verification code below:</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="verification-code">
            <div class="code">{{verificationCode}}</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
            <p>This verification code will expire in <strong>10 minutes</strong>. If you didn't request this verification, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="warning">
            <p class="warning-text">
                <strong>Security Notice:</strong> Never share this verification code with anyone. file-am will never ask for your verification code.
            </p>
        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
            <p>&copy; file-am. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
